# "This creature can't block": Bot2's Llanowar Elves attacks Bot1 on turn 4; Starscape Cleric (untapped, a flier that could
# otherwise block it) may not block it (`! Bot1.Block(Starscape Cleric > Llanowar Elves)`), while Ornithopter, the positive control,
# may and does. The Elves are blocked and deal no damage to Bot1: it stays on 20, and Ornithopter (0/2) survives.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Starscape Cleric
Ornithopter
Island x3
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Starscape Cleric.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet#2.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot1)
! Bot1.Block(Starscape Cleric > Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Block(Ornithopter > Llanowar Elves)
[T4 Bot2.End]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 1
